{"unit_id":"liuyun847__dsh-client-ui-peak-valley#card-zh","repo":"liuyun847/dsh-client-ui-peak-valley","commit":"24fbfb9657b814c4b071e5c99a92df77e6f2f834","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-peak-valley 是 DSH Web 客户端插件，在模型选择按钮旁显示 DeepSeek API 当前处于峰价还是谷价。它把状态提示注册到对话输入区，并根据当前模型 id 判断是否显示；峰谷时段按北京时间工作日、节假日和每日时段计算。插件内置 2024 至 2026 年节假日日期，其他年份可从 timor.tech 补充，并在浏览器本地缓存。适合希望在选择 DeepSeek 模型时快速查看当前价格时段的用户。无需 API 密钥或额外账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:221-240","lib/client.js:254-373"]}
{"unit_id":"liuyun847__dsh-client-ui-peak-valley#card-en","repo":"liuyun847/dsh-client-ui-peak-valley","commit":"24fbfb9657b814c4b071e5c99a92df77e6f2f834","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-client-ui-peak-valley is a DSH web plugin that shows DeepSeek peak or off-peak status beside the model picker. It uses Beijing time, weekdays and holidays to calculate periods. Dates for 2024–2026 are bundled; other years can be fetched from timor.tech and cached locally. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:221-240","lib/client.js:254-373"]}
{"unit_id":"liuyun847__dsh-client-ui-peak-valley#intent-1","repo":"liuyun847/dsh-client-ui-peak-valley","commit":"24fbfb9657b814c4b071e5c99a92df77e6f2f834","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"想在选模型时看现在是不是 DeepSeek 的高峰时段。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:254-289"]}
