{"unit_id":"liuyun847__dsh-client-ui-peak-valley#feature-1","repo":"liuyun847/dsh-client-ui-peak-valley","commit":"24fbfb9657b814c4b071e5c99a92df77e6f2f834","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-peak-valley 的功能「峰谷状态提示」：在对话输入区模型按钮旁显示色块和“峰价”或“谷价”。当前模型 id 含 deepseek 时显示，切换模型后更新。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:254-289","lib/client.js:373"]}
{"unit_id":"liuyun847__dsh-client-ui-peak-valley#feature-2","repo":"liuyun847/dsh-client-ui-peak-valley","commit":"24fbfb9657b814c4b071e5c99a92df77e6f2f834","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-peak-valley 的功能「按北京时间判断时段」：将当前时间按 UTC+8 换算，工作日的 9 至 12 点和 14 至 18 点为峰段，周末和法定节假日为谷段。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:208-240"]}
{"unit_id":"liuyun847__dsh-client-ui-peak-valley#feature-3","repo":"liuyun847/dsh-client-ui-peak-valley","commit":"24fbfb9657b814c4b071e5c99a92df77e6f2f834","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-peak-valley 的功能「补充节假日日期」：静态日期表以外的年份会请求 timor.tech 获取节假日信息，并在浏览器本地缓存七天；接口不可用时仍按工作日和周末判断。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:80-88","lib/client.js:165-205"]}
{"unit_id":"liuyun847__dsh-client-ui-peak-valley#feature-4","repo":"liuyun847/dsh-client-ui-peak-valley","commit":"24fbfb9657b814c4b071e5c99a92df77e6f2f834","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-peak-valley 的功能「新会话模型识别」：读取模型选择投影，并回退到会话模型目录当前项，以便新会话还没有投影值时也能判断是否显示状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:254-289"]}
{"unit_id":"liuyun847__dsh-client-ui-peak-valley#caveat-1","repo":"liuyun847/dsh-client-ui-peak-valley","commit":"24fbfb9657b814c4b071e5c99a92df77e6f2f834","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-peak-valley 使用 timor.tech 补取静态日期表以外年份的节假日，并将日期缓存于浏览器 localStorage 七天；接口不可用时按普通工作日和周末规则回退。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:80-88","lib/client.js:165-205"]}
